      images: [], sketch: "cards/sketches/P11.svg", solutionFig: "cards/solutions/P11.svg", keyInfo: "simultaneously → same t\nfrom the same point → same start\nstraight road → trajectory: line\nopposite directions → + and −\nconstant speeds → |v| = const\nAfter one minute → t = 1 min\n580 m apart → d\n20 km/h → v_A\nDetermine the speed of cyclist B → find v_B",
