      statement: "High-speed filming shows that the head of a golf club touches the ball for only 0.40 ms. In that time the ball goes from rest to 80 m/s.\n(a) Find the average acceleration of the ball while it is in contact with the club.\n(b) A Shinkansen train speeds up at 0.72 m/s². How long would the train need to gain the same 80 m/s?\n(c) How many times larger is the ball's acceleration than the train's?",
