      statement: "Two friends stand on a footbridge 34 m above a river. One lets a pebble drop from rest. Half a second later the other throws a pebble straight down, and both pebbles hit the water at the same moment. Take g = 9.81 m/s².\n(a) How long is the first pebble in the air?\n(b) How long is the second pebble in the air?\n(c) With what speed was the second pebble thrown?",
