      answer: "(a) Earth: t ≈ 4.3 s, H ≈ 23 m, R ≈ 92 m; Moon: t ≈ 27 s, H ≈ 140 m, R ≈ 560 m\n(b) all three ×6, because each is proportional to 1/g",
