      images: [], sketch: "cards/sketches/P97.svg", solutionFig: "cards/solutions/P97.svg", keyInfo: "The garden wall is 5.0 m high → h_w\nYou can throw at 20 m/s → u\njust clear the wall at the very top of its flight → H = h_w, top above the wall\nleaving your hand at ground level → y = 0 at the start\nTake g = 10 m/s² → g\nignore air resistance → a_x = 0, a_y = −g\nAt what angle must you throw → find α\nHow far from the wall must you stand → find d\nCould you get the ball over a wall 25 m high → compare with the largest H",
