      statement: "A body moves along the x-axis according to x = 5 + 2t + 4t² (everything in SI units).\n(a) Where was the body at t = 0, and what were its initial velocity and its acceleration?\n(b) Write vₓ(t).\n(c) Find vₓ at t = 2.0 s.",
