      statement: "A sealed rigid steel bottle of volume 5.0 × 10⁻³ m³ contains a monatomic ideal gas at a pressure of 2.0 × 10⁵ Pa. The bottle is left in the sun and the pressure of the gas rises to 2.6 × 10⁵ Pa.\n(a) State the work done by the gas.\n(b) Calculate the thermal energy absorbed by the gas.",
