      images: [], figures: ["cards/figures/A2-P016_1.svg", "cards/figures/A2-P016_2.svg"], keyInfo: "rests on a table → at rest: A = B\nforces A and B → name them\n4.2 N → F\nat a constant speed → a = 0: friction = 4.2 N\ntype of friction → moving: dynamic\nmagnitude of the frictional force → find F_f\nmass of 1.2 kg → m\ncoefficient of dynamic friction → find μ_d = F_f/N",
      statement: "(a) A wooden block rests on a table as shown.\n[Figure 1]\nState the forces A and B acting on the block. [2]\n(b) A force of 4.2 N is applied to the block to move it along the table at a constant speed.\n[Figure 2]\nState the type of friction now present between the block and the table. [1]\n(c) State the magnitude of the frictional force on the block. [1]\n(d) The block has a mass of 1.2 kg. Calculate the coefficient of dynamic friction between the block and the table. [4]",
