      statement: "A steel ball and a table-tennis ball are thrown horizontally from a balcony with the same velocity. Air resistance is negligible for the steel ball but not for the table-tennis ball.\nWhich ball lands first, and which one lands further from the balcony?\n\n| | Lands first | Lands further |\n|---|---|---|\n| A. | steel ball | steel ball |\n| B. | steel ball | table-tennis ball |\n| C. | table-tennis ball | steel ball |\n| D. | table-tennis ball | table-tennis ball |",
